s=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-07-16\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-07-16\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-07-16\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=%20Vive%20Le%20Punk%20%281993%29%20Screening&dates=20260716T180000Z/20260716T213000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/vive-le-punk-screening?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A rare screening of <strong><em>Vive Le Punk</em></strong> [1993], an exclusive documentary made by <strong>Roger K Burton</strong>, featuring <strong>Malcolm McLaren &amp; Vivienne Westwood</strong>. The couple were captured on film at <strong>the Horse Hospital </strong>on the eve of our very first exhibition, <strong><em>Vive Le Punk</em>.&nbsp;</strong>We will also be displaying select pieces featured in the original exhibition<strong>.</strong></p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/vive-le-punk-screening\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"6a2ac1bd1e5e8163ced90afb\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n