n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-06-13\">9:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-06-13\">18:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-06-13\">21:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Father%20of%20Lies%20by%20Folu%20Odimayo&dates=20260613T170000Z/20260613T200000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/father-of-lies?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>Father of Lies</em> is a film and performance-based installation that looks at mainstream media and it’s role within the facilitation of Genocide, war and societal division</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/father-of-lies\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"6a0cbf64b2f4b22eb6ebba7a\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1779224263671-1J96XMAGLO4J33PMK0J4\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1779224263671-1J96XMAGLO4J33PMK0J4/Stills4.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/father-of-lies\" data-title=\"Father of Lies by Folu Odimayo\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-the-finder-and-the-moon\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228919324-AP26Y4JE6JVDCFI3GKRF/L+June+-+Billetto.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228919324-AP26Y4JE6JVDCFI3GKRF/L+June+-+Billetto.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1667x958\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Miskatonic: The Finder and The Moon: Real UFOs Caught on Film\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-the-finder-and-the-moon\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Jun</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">9</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Talk\">Talk</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/miskatonic-the-finder-and-the-moon\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Miskatonic: The Finder and The Moon: Real UFOs Caught on Film</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-06-09\">Tuesday 9 June 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-06-09\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-06-09\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-06-09\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-06-09\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Miskatonic%3A%20The%20Finder%20and%20The%20Moon%3A%20Real%20UFOs%20Caught%20on%20Film&dates=20260609T180000Z/20260609T213000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-the-finder-and-the-moon?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Mark Pilkington</strong>, author of the UFO meta-conspiracy classic <em>Mirage Men</em>, presents a curated selection of his favourite filmic artefacts from the flying saucer era and beyond. Against the backdrop of the longest sustained wave of UFO coverage in the United States since the 1940s—culminating in a series of inconclusive congressional hearings—this lecture examines how moving images shape belief, doubt, and wonder.</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-the-finder-and-the-moon\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69838c8216f5e564f446a959\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1770228919324-AP26Y4JE6JVDCFI3GKRF\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228919324-AP26Y4JE6JVDCFI3GKRF/L+June+-+Billetto.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/miskatonic-the-finder-and-the-moon\" data-title=\"Miskatonic: The Finder and The Moon: Real UFOs Caught on Film\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/divfuse\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1777377962640-APT4D36353KRAST5WJ9M/Untitled-2.png\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1777377962640-APT4D36353KRAST5WJ9M/Untitled-2.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"905x678\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Project DIVFUSE External\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/divfuse\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Jun</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">7</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:30 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:30</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Improvisation\">Improvisation</a>, <a href=\"?category=Music\">Music</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/divfuse\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Project DIVFUSE External</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-06-07\">Sunday 7 June 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-06-07\">7:30 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-06-07\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-06-07\">19:30</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-06-07\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Project%20DIVFUSE%20External&dates=20260607T183000Z/20260607T213000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/divfuse?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Project DIVFUSE</strong>&nbsp;is presenting its second off-site event and a first one at The Horse Hospital. Bringing together several artists who have exhibited or performed at&nbsp;<strong>Project DIVFUSE</strong>&nbsp;micro art space in Lower Clapton E5 since its doors first opened to the public in July 2021, this is an evening to showcase sound inspired films. </p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/divfuse\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69f09d0d0c52b52f8ca2b418\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1777377962640-APT4D36353KRAST5WJ9M\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1777377962640-APT4D36353KRAST5WJ9M/Untitled-2.png\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/divfuse\" data-title=\"Project DIVFUSE External\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/reproduce-viewing-room\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1779787947412-OIJ7SCG2BENXXTSLZ8D3/da348594468cd3e8145da464ab538bf275e5cd8e.webp\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1779787947412-OIJ7SCG2BENXXTSLZ8D3/da348594468cd3e8145da464ab538bf275e5cd8e.webp\" data-image-dimensions=\"595x841\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"REProduce Viewing Room: Koi Hain (Screening) / Bass Boss (Screening)\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/reproduce-viewing-room\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">May</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">30</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Music\">Music</a>, <a href=\"?category=Talk\">Talk</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/reproduce-viewing-room\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">REProduce Viewing Room: Koi Hain (Screening) / Bass Boss (Screening)</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-05-30\">Saturday 30 May 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-05-30\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-05-30\">10:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-05-30\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-05-30\">22:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=REProduce%20Viewing%20Room%3A%20Koi%20Hain%20%28Screening%29%20%2F%20Bass%20Boss%20%28Screening%29&dates=20260530T180000Z/20260530T210000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/reproduce-viewing-room?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Two films. Two sound systems. One evening exploring what happens when technology becomes ritual, and machines become the medium of devotion. This event centres the apparatus: the speaker 