\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Talk\">Talk</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/miskatonic-blood-work\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Miskatonic: Blood Work: The Craft and Culture of Gore Cinema</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-05-12\">Tuesday 12 May 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-05-12\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-05-12\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-05-12\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-05-12\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Miskatonic%3A%20Blood%20Work%3A%20The%20Craft%20and%20Culture%20of%20Gore%20Cinema&dates=20260512T180000Z/20260512T213000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-blood-work?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Often dismissed as gratuitous or artistically empty, gore remains one of horror cinema’s most contested pleasures. This lecture reframes gore as an aesthetic practice rooted in tactility, craft, and collaboration. Tracing the devaluation of gore films and their fandoms, it situates graphic violence within broader artistic traditions and examines practical effects as a form of resistance to digital smoothness. </p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-blood-work\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69838b88a372792e52f2551a\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1770228653854-O8P84TAHEZQMJFMXHCMI\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228653854-O8P84TAHEZQMJFMXHCMI/L+May+-+Billetto.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/miskatonic-blood-work\" data-title=\"Miskatonic: Blood Work: The Craft and Culture of Gore Cinema\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/the-perfect-number\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773955517509-E2EJBKLTPNF5Z4W7ZVIK/HH+jpeg.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773955517509-E2EJBKLTPNF5Z4W7ZVIK/HH+jpeg.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1920x1080\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"The Perfect Number\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/the-perfect-number\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">May</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">8</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Live\">Live</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Performance\">Performance</a>, <a href=\"?category=Theatre\">Theatre</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/the-perfect-number\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">The Perfect Number</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-05-08\">Friday 8 May 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-05-08\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-05-08\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-05-08\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-05-08\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=The%20Perfect%20Number&dates=20260508T180000Z/20260508T213000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/the-perfect-number?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A unique interaction of film and live performance, where the narrator/performer exists in many different shapes and places.</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/the-perfect-number\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69bc673f37457c02c8ed068a\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1773955517509-E2EJBKLTPNF5Z4W7ZVIK\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773955517509-E2EJBKLTPNF5Z4W7ZVIK/HH+jpeg.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/the-perfect-number\" data-title=\"The Perfect Number\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/nitrate-kisses\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773764799418-TGG3V9RBASPOOSJD2QGC/poster_a3.png\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773764799418-TGG3V9RBASPOOSJD2QGC/poster_a3.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"2500x1875\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Sunday Screenings: Nitrate Kisses + Lot In Sodom with live score (afternoon event)\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/nitrate-kisses\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Apr</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">26</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">1:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">13:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/nitrate-kisses\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Sunday Screenings: Nitrate Kisses + Lot In Sodom with live score (afternoon event)</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-04-26\">Sunday 26 April 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-26\">1:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-26\">4:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-26\">13:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-26\">16:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Sunday%20Screenings%3A%20Nitrate%20Kisses%20%2B%20Lot%20In%20Sodom%20with%20live%20score%20%28afternoon%20event%29&dates=20260426T120000Z/20260426T150000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/nitrate-kisses?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A series of afternoon underground queer cinema at The Horse Hospital. <em>Nitrate Kisses</em> (1992) is the first feature documentary by Barbara Hammer, a pioneer of lesbian cinema. It weaves striking images of four gay and lesbian couples with footage of an unearthed forbidden and invisible history. Archival footage from the first gay film in the U.S., <em>Lot In Sodom </em>(1933) is interwoven in this haunting documentary. This will be screened proceeded the film, with a live score. </p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/nitrate-kisses\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69b97b2eceab4b17eb86de75\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1773764799418-TGG3V9RBASPOOSJD2QGC\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773764799418-TGG3V9RBASPOOSJD2QGC/poster_a3.png\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/nitrate-kisses\" data-title=\"Sunday Screenings: Nitrate Kisses + Lot In Sodom with live score (afternoon event)\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/mindwarcinema02\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1774270713468-7T8IB67QP04236Z96IFX/poster_v5_a3.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1774270713468-7T8IB67QP04236Z96IFX/poster_v5_a3.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"2500x1875\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"MINDWARCINEMA: The Arrival | Tanner F. Boyle &amp;amp; Mark Pilkington in converstaion\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/mindwarcinema02\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Apr</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">23</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Talk\">Talk</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/mindwarcinema02\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">MINDWARCINEMA: The Arrival | Tanner F. Boyle &amp; Mark Pilkington in converstaion</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-04-23\">Thursday 23 April 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-23\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-23\">10:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-23\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-23\">22:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=MINDWARCINEMA%3A%20The%20Arrival%20%7C%20Tanner%20F.%20Boyle%20%26amp%3B%20Mark%20Pilkington%20in%20converstaion&dates=20260423T180000Z/20260423T210000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/mindwarcinema02?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Mindwarcinema</strong> present a screening of the cult classic <strong>The Arrival</strong> (1980), directed by <strong>Ruth Norman</strong> of The <strong>Unarius Academy of Science</strong>. The screening will be accompanied by an in conversation between <strong>Tanner F Boyle</strong>, author of <em>Getting Spooked</em> and <em>The Fortean Influence on Science Fiction</em>) and <strong>Mark Pilkington</strong> (author of <em>Mirage Men </em>and publisher of <strong>Stranger Attractor Press</strong>).  </p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/mindwarcinema02\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69c12fdc12786c0c16febb6e\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1774270713468-7T8IB67QP04236Z96IFX\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1774270713468-7T8IB67QP04236Z96IFX/poster_v5_a3.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/mindwarcinema02\" data-title=\"MINDWARCINEMA: The Arrival | Tanner F. Boyle &amp;amp; Mark Pilkington in converstaion\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/black-is-black-aint\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773763279605-YCHSPXT9FC3Q6Q24C0LK/poster_a3.png\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773763279605-YCHSPXT9FC3Q6Q24C0LK/poster_a3.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"2139x1200\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Sunday Screenings: Black Is… Black Ain't + Tom Rubnitz short films (afternoon event)\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/black-is-black-aint\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Apr</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">19</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">1:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">13:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/black-is-black-aint\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Sunday Screenings: Black Is… Black Ain't + Tom Rubnitz short films (afternoon event)</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-04-19\">Sunday 19 April 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-19\">1:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-19\">4:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-19\">13:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-19\">16:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Sunday%20Screenings%3A%20Black%20Is%E2%80%A6%20Black%20Ain%27t%20%2B%20Tom%20Rubnitz%20short%20films%20%28afternoon%20event%29&dates=20260419T120000Z/20260419T150000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/black-is-black-aint?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A series of afternoon underground queer cinema at The Horse Hospital. <em>Black is… Black Ain’t </em>(1995) is the final film of director <strong>Marlon Riggs</strong>. His camera traverses the country, bringing us face to face with Black folks young and old, rich and poor, rural and urban, gay and straight, grappling with the paradox of numerous, often contested definitions of Blackness. Hooked up to an IV in his hospital bed, Riggs takes strength for his struggle against AIDS from the continual resilience of the African Americans in the face of overwhelming oppression. The screening is proceeded by a selection of shorts by video artist <strong>Tom Rubnitz</strong>. </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/black-is-black-aint\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69b977fabeca814d9502dcb4\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1773763279605-YCHSPXT9FC3Q6Q24C0LK\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773763279605-YCHSPXT9FC3Q6Q24C0LK/poster_a3.png\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/black-is-black-aint\" data-title=\"Sunday Screenings: Black Is… Black Ain't + Tom Rubnitz short films (afternoon event)\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-be-one-of-the-good-ones\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228442683-GJKDWPCROBL2YK7AGEAS/L+April+-+Billetto.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228442683-GJKDWPCROBL2YK7AGEAS/L+April+-+Billetto.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1667x958\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Miskatonic: Be One of the Good Ones: His House and Colonial Capitalist Hauntings\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-be-one-of-the-good-ones\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Apr</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">14</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Talk\">Talk</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/miskatonic-be-one-of-the-good-ones\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Miskatonic: Be One of the Good Ones: His House and Colonial Capitalist Hauntings</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-04-14\">Tuesday 14 April 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-14\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-14\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-14\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-14\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Miskatonic%3A%20Be%20One%20of%20the%20Good%20Ones%3A%20His%20House%20and%20Colonial%20Capitalist%20Hauntings&dates=20260414T180000Z/20260414T213000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-be-one-of-the-good-ones?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>His House</em> (2020) is a ghost story about displacement, precarity, and the inescapable afterlives of empire. This lecture situates the film within a global “horror cinema of precarity” that uses the genre to address marginalised experiences. Drawing on postcolonial Gothic and hauntological theory, it explores how Britain’s imperial and capitalist legacies haunt the film atmospherically rather than corporeally. </p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-be-one-of-the-good-ones\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69838aad749df347e0c7ac38\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1770228442683-GJKDWPCROBL2YK7AGEAS\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228442683-GJKDWPCROBL2YK7AGEAS/L+April+-+Billetto.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/miskatonic-be-one-of-the-good-ones\" data-title=\"Miskatonic: Be One of the Good Ones: His House and Colonial Capitalist Hauntings\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/buddies\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773763161954-UK8M8AG5K620SAJNGX54/poster_a3.png\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773763161954-UK8M8AG5K620SAJNGX54/poster_a3.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"2122x1167\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Sunday Screenings: Buddies + Tom Rubnitz short films (afternoon event)\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/buddies\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Apr</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">12</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">1:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">13:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/buddies\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Sunday Screenings: Buddies + Tom Rubnitz short films (afternoon event)</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-04-12\">Sunday 12 April 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-12\">1:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-12\">4:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-12\">13:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-12\">16:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Sunday%20Screenings%3A%20Buddies%20%2B%20Tom%20Rubnitz%20short%20films%20%28afternoon%20event%29&dates=20260412T120000Z/20260412T150000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/buddies?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A series of afternoon underground queer cinema at The Horse Hospital. <em>Buddies </em>(1985), directed by <strong>Arthur Bressan Jr.</strong>, was the first narrative film made about AIDS. Alongside <em>Buddies</em>, <strong>Bressan</strong> is known for the documentary <em>Gay USA </em>and a number of pornographic films. The screening will be proceeded by a selection of shorts directed by the video artist and AIDS activist <strong>Tom Rubnitz</strong>. </p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/buddies\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69b97185887999329f66bead\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1773763161954-UK8M8AG5K620SAJNGX54\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773763161954-UK8M8AG5K620SAJNGX54/poster_a3.png\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/buddies\" data-title=\"Sunday Screenings: Buddies + Tom Rubnitz short films (afternoon event)\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/luisa-the3kayas-nymity\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1775063312974-N041SI0BP8IAQRYEKD63/KAYA_LOW+RES_0214.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1775063312974-N041SI0BP8IAQRYEKD63/KAYA_LOW+RES_0214.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"3603x2627\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.49525,0.3901098901098901\" alt=\"THE3KAYAS + Luisa D Rozo + Nymity (DJ)\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/luisa-the3kayas-nymity\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Apr</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">11</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Music\">Music</a>, <a href=\"?category=Live\">Live</a>, <a href=\"?category=Performance\">Performance</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/luisa-the3kayas-nymity\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">THE3KAYAS + Luisa D Rozo + Nymity (DJ)</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-04-11\">Saturday 11 April 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-11\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-11\">11:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-04-11\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-04-11\">23:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=THE3KAYAS%20%2B%20Luisa%20D%20Rozo%20%2B%20Nymity%20%28DJ%29&dates=20260411T180000Z/20260411T223000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/luisa-the3kayas-nymity?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A multidisciplinary bill, mixing auto-fictional film, live vocals from the heart and independent performance makers <strong>Luisa D Rozo</strong> and <strong>THE3KAYAS</strong>, alongside fine tune slector <strong>Nymity</strong></p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/luisa-the3kayas-nymity\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69c9995bb6cd1551c8f5a28c\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1775063312974-N041SI0BP8IAQRYEKD63\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1775063312974-N041SI0BP8IAQRYEKD63/KAYA_LOW+RES_0214.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/luisa-the3kayas-nymity\" data-title=\"THE3KAYAS + Luisa D Rozo + Nymity (DJ)\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/bad-bias\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773347011845-9KVTNG3EF9OF1P3ZADJV/Event+Poster+%281%29.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773347011845-9KVTNG3EF9OF1P3ZADJV/Event+Poster+%281%29.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1080x1350\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.484\" alt=\"COVID-26: Bad Bias in the Body\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/bad-bias\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Mar</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">30</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:30 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:30</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Movement\">Movement</a>, <a href=\"?category=Sound\">Sound</a>, <a href=\"?category=Performance\">Performance</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/bad-bias\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">COVID-26: Bad Bias in the Body</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-03-30\">Monday 30 March 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-03-30\">7:30 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-03-30\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-03-30\">19:30</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-03-30\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=COVID-26%3A%20Bad%20Bias%20in%20the%20Body&dates=20260330T183000Z/20260330T213000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/bad-bias?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">What remains in the body after COVID-era anti-Asian racism? A multidisciplinary event exploring how anti-Asian hate during COVID registered in the body and how it might be released together with live performances from <strong>Ming Chin Hsieh</strong> and <strong>Angela Wai Nok Hui</strong></p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/bad-bias\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69b31b293dfdf11396aea19a\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1773347011845-9KVTNG3EF9OF1P3ZADJV\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1773347011845-9KVTNG3EF9OF1P3ZADJV/Event+Poster+%281%29.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/bad-bias\" data-title=\"COVID-26: Bad Bias in the Body\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-terminal-desert\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228210013-FBKXZVXW9L2MTMNUOXEJ/L+March+-+Billetto.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228210013-FBKXZVXW9L2MTMNUOXEJ/L+March+-+Billetto.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1667x958\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Miskatonic: Terminal Desert: From Trinity Site to the Ends of the Earth (via Bronson Canyon)\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-terminal-desert\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Mar</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">10</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Talk\">Talk</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/miskatonic-terminal-desert\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Miskatonic: Terminal Desert: From Trinity Site to the Ends of the Earth (via Bronson Canyon)</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-03-10\">Tuesday 10 March 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-03-10\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-03-10\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-03-10\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-03-10\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Miskatonic%3A%20Terminal%20Desert%3A%20From%20Trinity%20Site%20to%20the%20Ends%20of%20the%20Earth%20%28via%20Bronson%20Canyon%29&dates=20260310T190000Z/20260310T223000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-terminal-desert?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">From <em>Greed</em> (1924) to post-apocalyptic cinema, the desert has served as one of horror’s most unforgiving landscapes. This lecture, presented by <strong>Ken Hollings</strong> for <strong>Miskatonic Institute of Horror Studies</strong>, traces how the American desert became a site of monsters, mutations, and moral collapse, shaped by atomic testing, exploitation cinema, and low-budget genre filmmaking.</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-terminal-desert\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"698389acc893961bc31ad540\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1770228210013-FBKXZVXW9L2MTMNUOXEJ\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228210013-FBKXZVXW9L2MTMNUOXEJ/L+March+-+Billetto.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/miskatonic-terminal-desert\" data-title=\"Miskatonic: Terminal Desert: From Trinity Site to the Ends of the Earth (via Bronson Canyon)\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-heavy-metal-horror\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228002202-6MU5YDK7TPSJ61FY6Q5I/jhlnsjmo0pkkv4ctk2y1bwoar1h1.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228002202-6MU5YDK7TPSJ61FY6Q5I/jhlnsjmo0pkkv4ctk2y1bwoar1h1.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1440x810\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Miskatonic: Heavy Metal Horror Film in 1980s’ USA: Moral Panic and Folk Devil Reactions\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-heavy-metal-horror\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Feb</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">10</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Talk\">Talk</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/miskatonic-heavy-metal-horror\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Miskatonic: Heavy Metal Horror Film in 1980s’ USA: Moral Panic and Folk Devil Reactions</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-02-10\">Tuesday 10 February 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-02-10\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-02-10\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-02-10\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-02-10\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Miskatonic%3A%20Heavy%20Metal%20Horror%20Film%20in%201980s%E2%80%99%20USA%3A%20Moral%20Panic%20and%20Folk%20Devil%20Reactions&dates=20260210T190000Z/20260210T223000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-heavy-metal-horror?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">This lecture, presented by <strong>Nedim Hassan </strong>for <strong>Miskatonic Institute of Horror Studies </strong>examines how metal fans and musicians were cast as “folk devils” within the 1980s culture wars, and how a cycle of horror films—including <em>Trick or Treat</em> and <em>Black Roses</em>—absorbed and refracted these anxieties. </p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-heavy-metal-horror\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69838857f5d9c73e39060a2b\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1770228002202-6MU5YDK7TPSJ61FY6Q5I\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1770228002202-6MU5YDK7TPSJ61FY6Q5I/jhlnsjmo0pkkv4ctk2y1bwoar1h1.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/miskatonic-heavy-metal-horror\" data-title=\"Miskatonic: Heavy Metal Horror Film in 1980s’ USA: Moral Panic and Folk Devil Reactions\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/tribulation-99\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/c3671d9d-a52c-412b-a3df-1dfffdb1738d/Screenshot+2026-01-07+at+11.03.15.png\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/c3671d9d-a52c-412b-a3df-1dfffdb1738d/Screenshot+2026-01-07+at+11.03.15.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"2488x1883\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Tribulation 99 | Tellurian Drama | T2S\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/tribulation-99\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Feb</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">4</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/tribulation-99\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Tribulation 99 | Tellurian Drama | T2S</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2026-02-04\">Wednesday 4 February 2026</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-02-04\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-02-04\">10:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2026-02-04\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2026-02-04\">22:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Tribulation%2099%20%7C%20Tellurian%20Drama%20%7C%20T2S&dates=20260204T190000Z/20260204T220000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/tribulation-99?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A screening of three films exploring the metaphysics of electromagnetic communication, psyops, and conspiracy. <strong>Craig Baldwin</strong>’s <em>Tribulation 99: Alien Anomalies Under America </em>(1992), <strong>Riar Rizaldi</strong>’s <em>Tellurian Drama </em>(2020), and <strong>Signal Warfare Research Unit</strong>’s <em>T2S</em>. </p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/tribulation-99\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"695ce929fb73ba4f27c2ee8d\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"c3671d9d-a52c-412b-a3df-1dfffdb1738d\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/c3671d9d-a52c-412b-a3df-1dfffdb1738d/Screenshot+2026-01-07+at+11.03.15.png\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/tribulation-99\" data-title=\"Tribulation 99 | Tellurian Drama | T2S\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/amurmur\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1762790954035-M17QY56FZ83KU6R8V7BH/Amurmur+event-3+%281%29.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1762790954035-M17QY56FZ83KU6R8V7BH/Amurmur+event-3+%281%29.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1414x2000\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Amurmur: Unquieten Memory\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/amurmur\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Dec</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">18</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:30 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:30</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Talk\">Talk</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/amurmur\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Amurmur: Unquieten Memory</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2025-12-18\">Thursday 18 December 2025</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2025-12-18\">7:30 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-12-18\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2025-12-18\">19:30</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-12-18\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Amurmur%3A%20Unquieten%20Memory&dates=20251218T193000Z/20251218T223000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/amurmur?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Amurmur</strong> is a platform celebrating memory, enshrinement and archives. For our first event, through readings and budding projects, a selection of artists share their impassioned ways of engaging with the past. Followed by a screening of a film by <strong>Ines Barquet</strong> and <strong>Ximena Prieto</strong>, based on an idea by <strong>Alexia Marmara</strong>.</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/amurmur\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"69120d7a67037d3f57f2d200\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1762790954035-M17QY56FZ83KU6R8V7BH\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1762790954035-M17QY56FZ83KU6R8V7BH/Amurmur+event-3+%281%29.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/amurmur\" data-title=\"Amurmur: Unquieten Memory\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/hackers-contemporary-wardrobe\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1762962737481-Y3BH28SK8A1AHZXCVOQ8/horse_hospital_hackers_screener_poster_hero_v01.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1762962737481-Y3BH28SK8A1AHZXCVOQ8/horse_hospital_hackers_screener_poster_hero_v01.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"3000x3750\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Hackers (1995) Screening: with costume and introduction\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnai