-12-17\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-12-17\">22:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Hackers%20%281995%29%20Screening%3A%20with%20costume%20and%20introduction&dates=20251217T190000Z/20251217T220000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/hackers-contemporary-wardrobe?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Hack the planet! Celebrating it’s 30th, a screening of <em>Hackers</em><strong> </strong>(1995), featuring costumes by <strong>Roger K. Burton</strong> on display. With an introduction by <strong>The Contemporary Wardrobe Collection</strong>. </p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/hackers-contemporary-wardrobe\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"6914ab857462fc788cb0287f\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1762962737481-Y3BH28SK8A1AHZXCVOQ8\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1762962737481-Y3BH28SK8A1AHZXCVOQ8/horse_hospital_hackers_screener_poster_hero_v01.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-ur