  </div>\n          </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-88abc60a2408d0d6c187\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Daniel Gatenio</strong> is an artist, facilitator. Born and raised in New York City he is now based in London where he lives with his cat Misha.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Daniel’s art practice stems from his lifelong interest in how things work (or don’t) and how things are made; explored via diagrams, drawing, photography, and other images. Daniel’s art and work practice are indistinguishable from each other; meeting notes, utility bills, electrical diagrams, and other work related ephemera often make their way into drawings and then back again.&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://gaten.io/\">https://gaten.io/</a> </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-horizontalrule horizontalrule-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.horizontalrule/fd311378-f51a-49e8-aa21-5543ebe3b17e_109/website.components.horizontalrule.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.horizontalrule/fd311378-f51a-49e8-aa21-5543ebe3b17e_109/website.components.horizontalrule.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.horizontalrule\" data-sqsp-block=\"line\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1777548185624_202683\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1777548185624_202683\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><hr 